·哈贾尔将荷兰大奖赛奖杯趣事融入红牛特别头盔设计","summaryZh":"红牛车队为四届F1世界冠军马克斯·维斯塔潘和队友伊萨克·哈贾尔推出了特别版头盔和赛车服，以纪念即将在赞德沃特举行的荷兰大奖赛，这将是该赛道在F1日历上的最后一站。哈贾尔头盔的设计融入了上赛季他在荷兰大奖赛上打碎奖杯的瞬间，这一趣事曾广为流传。","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T08:50:42.393Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-17T12:46:04.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-8.motorsport.com/images/amp/6grQQRxY/s6/isack-hadjar-red-bull-racing.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":223216,"altZh":"伊萨克·哈贾尔将荷兰大奖赛奖杯趣事融入红牛特别头盔设计"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/isack-hadjar-turns-viral-dutch-gp-trophy-moment-into-special-red-bull-helmet-design/10846865/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-474be038fec625bbce5e044c92b67ff67dbd4130aa2646c7e54954825ad3f1b2","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"艾伦·麦克尼什盛赞博尔托莱托：具备“巨大潜力”","summaryZh":"奥迪赛车总监艾伦·麦克尼什深入剖析了加布里埃尔·博尔托莱托成为F1车手所具备的心态。博尔托莱托连续赢得F3和F2冠军后，于去年在欣维尔车队（当时名为索伯）完成世界锦标赛首秀。2025赛季，他以19比51的积分落后于老将队友尼科·霍肯伯格，但在2026年夏休期前，他以10比2领先。","publishedAt":"2026-08-19T11:08:42.405Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-17T11:23:32.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/0arKZ8p2/s6/gabriel-bortoleto-audi-f1-team.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":223122,"altZh":"艾伦·麦克尼什盛赞博尔托莱托：具备“巨大潜力”"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/allan-mcnish-reveals-qualities-that-give-gabriel-bortoleto-a-lot-of-potential/10846068/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"pub